== Notes ==

* Mantles do not absorb all spells, just the ones that check spell resistance.
* This spell replaces earlier castings of itself, and it also displaces earlier castings of ''lesser spell mantle'' and ''spell mantle''.
*The empowered version of ''[[spell mantle]]'' also occupies a level 9 [[spell slot]] but absorbs 13-24 spell levels before collapsing (more than the 11-22 absorbed by this spell). Mages with the [[empower spell]] feat &mdash; particularly [[sorcerer]]s, who have a limited spell selection &mdash; may want to use ''spell mantle'' (empowered) instead of this spell.
* Due to a .2da bug, ''greater spell breach'' is not an additional [[counterspell]] of this spell.

